# project spec & tech stack
stack
    frontend: React + Redux RTK (MUI + SASS)
    backend: Python (FastAPI / Django)
    db: Postgres + pgvector
    Inf: Kubernetes, Docker, Terraform, Ansible
    CI/CD & test: GitHub Actions, Cypress, Jest
    Monitoring: Datadog, Sentry

auth/ admin
    standard user signup/login + email verification flow
    OAuth integration (Google / Outlook SSO)
    role-based user management & access controls

project admin & security
    full CRUD for projects + user permissions per project
    secret keys: auto-generate project API secret key on creation
    require secret key verification for high-risk actions

local vision / multimodal model API
    pull list of locally downloaded open-source HuggingFace / Ollama vision models over API
    build a config layer to support a select set first
    labled .dicom files, extract metadata, insights out (classification, metadata csv (PCA analysis on that?), natural langauge select statements). 
    classification of new image, confidence rating,   